<title>UK: CSFP to launch 5.0 bln escudo Brazil-linked FRN.</title>
<headline>CSFP to launch 5.0 bln escudo Brazil-linked FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse Financial Products is to launch a 5.0 billion escudo three-year FRN, Banco Santander de Negocios Portugal said on Wednesday as joint lead manager.</p>
<p>The notes, which will secured on Brazilian Debt Conversion Bonds due 2012, will pay six-month LISBOR plus 160 basis points.</p>
<p>The Luxembourg-listed deal will have a July 10 payment date.</p>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston will be also be joint lead manager.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
